  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 103.01 Composition of the Board. The board consists of the members as specified in RSA 328-F:4, VI, to include 2 licensed physical therapists, one physical therapist assistant, and 2 public members.\n\nSource. #9039, eff 11-28-07; ss by #12993, eff 2-22-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Phy 100); ss by #14385, eff 9-23-25",
